Routine local source edits, tests, audit artifacts and incremental Git commits are authorized by this implementation request. Continue autonomously through them without asking for permission at each phase. Preserve pre-existing modifications and commit small coherent increments with clear messages.

Before changing live service behavior, activating new dispatch, altering the active production database, stopping workers or changing shared routing, present one concise, targeted change/rollback plan and obtain approval. Stage and prove fixes in disposable environments first. Do not deploy, publish, alter accounts, buy credits, remove user work, or modify unrelated projects/profiles without permission.

